    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "d19fd4c6ec9fde47f0df": "Stonetalon Mountain has many perilous caves through out this region.  Exploring these caves can hold many adventures for those willing to risk life for glory.$B$B$C, perhaps you seek riches that only following your heart and soul can garnish."
      },
      "name": "Mor'rogal",
      "translationMetadata": {
